<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India BSE Index on Sept 6.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India BSE Index on Sept 6.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Friday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day upto 0630 GMT and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index (at 0630 GMT) was 3529.18, 12.28 points or 0.35 percent higher than Wednesday's close.</p>
